claude-code:
Set up HookFeed hooks for Claude Code. HookFeed is my local Mac inbox for agent updates.
1. If ~/.claude/settings.json exists, copy it to a timestamped backup beside the original.
2. Merge the hooks below into it. Keep every existing setting and hook, and don't add HookFeed entries twice.
3. Check the file is still valid JSON and show me what changed.
4. The hooks apply to new Claude Code sessions.

{
  "hooks" : {
    "Notification" : [
      {
        "hooks" : [
          {
            "command" : "'/Applications/HookFeed.app/Contents/Helpers/hookfeed' hook claude-code",
            "timeout" : 1,
            "type" : "command"
          }
        ],
        "matcher" : "permission_prompt|elicitation_dialog|agent_needs_input"
      }
    ],
    "Stop" : [
      {
        "hooks" : [
          {
            "command" : "'/Applications/HookFeed.app/Contents/Helpers/hookfeed' hook claude-code",
            "timeout" : 1,
            "type" : "command"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}

